      <aside class="border-t border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950" aria-label="Independent service notice">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-6 sm:px-6">
          <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-zinc-400">Best Invoice Generator is an independent, browser-based invoice tool. It is not affiliated with Google, OpenAI, Shopify, PayPal, Wise, or other brands mentioned in educational content.</p>
        </div>
